---
title: Pigs in Blankets and White Bean Traybake
description: One-tray festive recipe pairing bacon-wrapped sausages with garlicky cannellini beans, shredded Brussel sprouts, and softened dried cranberries
source: https://inews.co.uk/inews-lifestyle/quick-easy-festive-meals-unexpected-guests-4100139
author: Ben Ebbrell
image: https://inews.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/SEI_277627461-e1765455056497.jpg?w=1200&h=675&crop=1
servings: 2
course: Main
prep time: 15m
cook time: 25m
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: British
tags:
- british
